List of maintainers
===================

Each entry describes one part of the tree. Send a change to the people listed
for the files it touches, and put the subsystem name in the commit subject.

Descriptions of the fields:

	M: Maintainer, reachable through the forge account given
	R: Reviewer, worth a look but not required
	S: Status: Supported, Maintained, Odd Fixes, Orphan
	F: Files and directories, wildcards allowed
	X: Excluded from a preceding F pattern
	P: Patch rules or notes for this area
	T: Test command that has to pass

